t/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675300","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4387750-1844751498232544","game_id":"steam-4387750","kind":"announcement","title":"Concrete Polishing Simulator Demo Launches October 13","summary":"Hello, concrete crew 👋THE DEMO LAUNCHES OCTOBER 13I'm excited to announce that the Concrete Polishing Simulator demo will be available on October 13.In the demo, you’ll step into the boots of a professional concrete polisher and experience the hands-on process of transforming an unfinished concrete slab.Operate professional-style equipment, work through multiple stages of the job, and watch the floor visibly change with every pass.BUILT FROM REAL EXPERIENCEConcrete Polishing Simulator is being d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T21:18:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232544","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4387750-1842212951311849","game_id":"steam-4387750","kind":"announcement","title":"Concrete Polishing Simulator Demo Coming Soon","summary":"The public demo for Concrete Polishing Simulator is almost ready! ːsteamhappyːCreated by an actual concrete polisher, Concrete Polishing Simulator takes you through the complete process of transforming damaged concrete into a professionally finished floor.In the demo, you’ll be able to:Learn the trade through the Contractor Basics training jobCut, hone, polish, stain, and seal concreteUse floor machines and hand grindersRestore Josie’s GarageTransform Evan’s PatioChoose contracts and build your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T00:52:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4387750-1833968530898773","game_id":"steam-4387750","kind":"announcement","title":"Concrete Polishing Simulator is still actively in development!","summary":"Hey everyone,This is the first official update here, and I just wanted to say thank you to anyone who has found the page, wishlisted the game, followed along, or even just taken a look.Concrete Polishing Simulator is very much still being worked on, and I’ve been building out the foundation for what I want this game to become: a satisfying, hands-on simulator focused on transforming rough concrete into clean, polished floors.There is still a lot more to show, and some big things are coming as de","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T21:11:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530898773","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4387750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:13:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:13:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4387750":"2026-10-26T02:13:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4387750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:13:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:13:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5088640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:13:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:13:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4387750","app_id":4387750,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d548b86accd7ec15144cf